OL,3,GNEWSARoad closed after bus crashes into
OL,4,Apub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe collision has sent rubble and
OL,7,Fdebris from the building into the road
OL,8,Fand caused extensive damage to the
OL,9,Ffront of the coach. Officers said one
OL,10,Fperson was taken to hospital with
OL,11,Finjuries not believed to be
OL,12,Flife-threatening or life-altering but
OL,13,Fthere had been no reports of anyone
OL,14,Felse being hurt.
OL,16,FE Coaches of Alfreton said this was its
OL,17,Fdriver, who had suffered "a medical
OL,18,Fepisode".
